@ pokeemerald data/maps/Route104/scripts.inc: Route104_Text_WhatsItLikeAtBottomOfSea
Hoenn_Route104_Text_WhatsItLikeAtBottomOfSea::
	.string "The sea, huh?\p"
	.string "I wonder what it's like at the bottom\n"
	.string "of the sea?$"

@ pokeemerald data/maps/Route104/scripts.inc: Route104_Text_BrineyLivesInSeasideCottage
Hoenn_Route104_Text_BrineyLivesInSeasideCottage::
	.string "That seaside cottage is where\n"
	.string "MR. BRINEY lives.\p"
	.string "He was once a mighty sailor who never\n"
	.string "feared the sea, however stormy.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route104_Text_HaleyIntro
Hoenn_Route104_Text_HaleyIntro::
	.string "Should I…\n"
	.string "Or shouldn't I?\p"
	.string "Okay, sure, I will battle!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route104_Text_HaleyDefeat
Hoenn_Route104_Text_HaleyDefeat::
	.string "I shouldn't have battled…$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route104_Text_HaleyPostBattle
Hoenn_Route104_Text_HaleyPostBattle::
	.string "If you're faced with a decision and\n"
	.string "you let someone else choose for you,\l"
	.string "you will regret it, however things\l"
	.string "turn out.$"

@ pokeemerald data/maps/Route104/scripts.inc: Route104_Text_ThrowBallAtWeakenedPokemon
Hoenn_Route104_Text_ThrowBallAtWeakenedPokemon::
	.string "If you're going to throw a POKé BALL,\n"
	.string "weaken the wild POKéMON first.\p"
	.string "It will be easier to catch if it's been\n"
	.string "poisoned, burned, or lulled to sleep.$"

@ pokeemerald data/maps/Route104/scripts.inc: Route104_Text_OnlyThrowBallAtWildPokemon
Hoenn_Route104_Text_OnlyThrowBallAtWildPokemon::
	.string "You're a thief if you try to steal\n"
	.string "someone else's POKéMON.\p"
	.string "You should throw POKé BALLS only at\n"
	.string "wild POKéMON.$"

@ pokeemerald data/maps/Route104/scripts.inc: Route104_Text_ImNotATrainer
Hoenn_Route104_Text_ImNotATrainer::
	.string "Oh, no, I'm not a TRAINER.\p"
	.string "But that's right, if TRAINERS lock eyes,\n"
	.string "it's a challenge to battle.\p"
	.string "If you don't want to battle, stay out\n"
	.string "of their sight.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route104_Text_IvanIntro
Hoenn_Route104_Text_IvanIntro::
	.string "Why keep it a secret?\n"
	.string "I'm the WATER POKéMON expert!\p"
	.string "Huh?\n"
	.string "You don't know me?$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route104_Text_IvanDefeat
Hoenn_Route104_Text_IvanDefeat::
	.string "I thought I wasn't too bad, if I may\n"
	.string "say so, but I guess not… Bleah…$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route104_Text_IvanPostBattle
Hoenn_Route104_Text_IvanPostBattle::
	.string "I got too into fishing.\n"
	.string "I forgot I had to raise my POKéMON…$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route104_Text_GinaIntro
Hoenn_Route104_Text_GinaIntro::
	.string "GINA: Okay, let's battle with our\n"
	.string "POKéMON!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route104_Text_GinaDefeat
Hoenn_Route104_Text_GinaDefeat::
	.string "GINA: Losing upsets me!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route104_Text_GinaNotEnoughMons
Hoenn_Route104_Text_GinaNotEnoughMons::
	.string "GINA: Oh? Only one POKéMON?\n"
	.string "Then, we don't battle with you.\p"
	.string "If there's only one POKéMON, it will\n"
	.string "be lonesome. That's not nice.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route104_Text_GinaPostBattle
Hoenn_Route104_Text_GinaPostBattle::
	.string "GINA: You are strong!\n"
	.string "We have to train lots more!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route104_Text_MiaIntro
Hoenn_Route104_Text_MiaIntro::
	.string "MIA: We are twins, so we battle\n"
	.string "POKéMON together.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route104_Text_MiaDefeat
Hoenn_Route104_Text_MiaDefeat::
	.string "MIA: We battled together, but we\n"
	.string "both lost…$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route104_Text_MiaNotEnoughMons
Hoenn_Route104_Text_MiaNotEnoughMons::
	.string "MIA: You want to battle with us?\p"
	.string "It's a big no-no if you don't have two\n"
	.string "POKéMON with you.\l"
	.string "We're too strong for you!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route104_Text_MiaPostBattle
Hoenn_Route104_Text_MiaPostBattle::
	.string "MIA: We will train our POKéMON more\n"
	.string "and be strong like you.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route104_Text_WinstonIntro
Hoenn_Route104_Text_WinstonIntro::
	.string "Oh, sure, I'll accept your challenge.\n"
	.string "I have a lot of money.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route104_Text_WinstonDefeat
Hoenn_Route104_Text_WinstonDefeat::
	.string "Why couldn't I win?$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route104_Text_WinstonPostBattle
Hoenn_Route104_Text_WinstonPostBattle::
	.string "There are some things money can't buy.\n"
	.string "That's POKéMON…$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route104_Text_CindyIntro
Hoenn_Route104_Text_CindyIntro::
	.string "We must have been fated to meet.\n"
	.string "May I ask you for a battle?$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route104_Text_CindyDefeat
Hoenn_Route104_Text_CindyDefeat::
	.string "Oh, my!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route104_Text_CindyPostBattle
Hoenn_Route104_Text_CindyPostBattle::
	.string "“Hello” is the beginning of “good-bye.”\n"
	.string "I hope we meet again.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route104_Text_BillyIntro
Hoenn_Route104_Text_BillyIntro::
	.string "Leaving footprints in the sand is\n"
	.string "so fun!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route104_Text_BillyDefeat
Hoenn_Route104_Text_BillyDefeat::
	.string "Waah! I got sand in my runners!\n"
	.string "They're all gritty!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route104_Text_BillyPostBattle
Hoenn_Route104_Text_BillyPostBattle::
	.string "I want to leave my footprints in\n"
	.string "the sand everywhere, but they\l"
	.string "disappear quickly…$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route104_Text_DarianIntro
Hoenn_Route104_Text_DarianIntro::
	.string "I fished up a tough-looking POKéMON!\p"
	.string "It has this magical quality to it!\n"
	.string "It surely looks tough, yes it does!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route104_Text_DarianDefeat
Hoenn_Route104_Text_DarianDefeat::
	.string "What the…$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route104_Text_DarianPostBattle
Hoenn_Route104_Text_DarianPostBattle::
	.string "Hey, MAGIKARP, you sure don't live up\n"
	.string "to your name, do you?$"

